# Docker build ignore rules for DigiBank.
#
# The Docker build context excludes Git metadata, IDE files, Maven target directories, logs, environment
# files, local Compose overrides, and evidence screenshots. This keeps images smaller and avoids sending
# local secrets or generated artifacts into the container build.
#
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
**/target
**/.mvn
*.log
.env
.env.*
docker-compose.override.yml
docs/evidence/screenshots
